@startuml StateMachine_Transaction_Lifecycle

title State Machine Diagram - Transaction Lifecycle\n(Payment Processing States)

[*] --> Pending : Create Payment Intent\nPaymentService.createPaymentIntent()

state "Pending" as pending #LightYellow {
    pending : Payment intent created
    pending : Waiting for user to complete payment
    pending : Stripe client_secret issued
    pending : Transaction record in database
}

state "Completed" as completed #LightGreen {
    completed : Payment successfully processed
    completed : Funds captured by Stripe
    completed : Associated booking confirmed
    completed : Final state (immutable)
}

state "Failed" as failed #LightPink {
    failed : Payment processing failed
    failed : Card declined or error occurred
    failed : No funds captured
    failed : Associated booking remains pending
}

state "Cancelled" as cancelled #LightGray {
    cancelled : Payment intent canceled
    cancelled : By user or system timeout
    cancelled : No funds captured
    cancelled : Associated booking may be canceled
}

pending --> Completed : Stripe Webhook\n[payment_intent.succeeded]\nWebhookService updates status
note on link
    **Webhook Event:** payment_intent.succeeded
    
    **Actions:**
    1. Verify not duplicate
    2. Update transaction.status = "Completed"
    3. Update booking.status = "confirmed"
    4. Send notifications
    
    **Idempotency:** Check if already processed
end note

pending --> Failed : Stripe Webhook\n[payment_intent.payment_failed]
note on link
    **Webhook Event:** payment_intent.payment_failed
    
    **Actions:**
    1. Update transaction.status = "Failed"
    2. Log payment error
    3. Keep booking as "pending"
    
    **User Can:** Retry payment with new intent
end note

pending --> Cancelled : Stripe Webhook\n[payment_intent.canceled]
note on link
    **Webhook Event:** payment_intent.canceled
    
    **Actions:**
    1. Update transaction.status = "Cancelled"
    2. Update booking.status = "canceled"
    
    **Reasons:**
    • User abandoned payment
    • System timeout
    • Admin cancellation
end note

pending --> Cancelled : Timeout\n[No payment within threshold]
note on link
    **Trigger:** Time-based (future implementation)
    
    **Condition:** Transaction pending > X minutes
    
    **Future:** Scheduled job to auto-cancel
end note

Completed --> [*] : Transaction Finalized
note on link: Immutable state - no further changes

Failed --> [*] : Archived
note on link: Can create new transaction for retry

Cancelled --> [*] : Archived

note right of pending
    **Entry Actions:**
    • Create transaction record
    • Store providerPaymentId
    • Link to booking
    • Set date = now
    
    **Invariants:**
    • Must have valid userId
    • Must have valid bookingId
    • Must have providerPaymentId
    • Amount > 0
end note

note right of Completed
    **Entry Actions:**
    • Mark booking as confirmed
    • Trigger notification factory
    • Send confirmations
    
    **Invariants:**
    • Immutable (cannot change)
    • Booking must be confirmed
    • Funds captured in Stripe
    
    **Side Effects:**
    • Customer charged
    • Revenue recorded
end note

note right of Failed
    **Entry Actions:**
    • Log failure reason
    • Preserve error details
    
    **Recovery:**
    • User can create new payment
    • Booking remains available
    • Original booking still pending
end note

note right of Cancelled
    **Entry Actions:**
    • Release payment hold
    • May update booking
    
    **Cleanup:**
    • Free resources
    • Archive for reporting
end note

@enduml
